			"notes": "- The mods that do the same job are listed as conflicts, so the loader says so at startup, and the readme says why.\n- A player who turned off Show me on maps is left off the minimap too.\n- An older Pandorical no longer keeps this out of a server: everyone shows on the minimap until Pandorical has the choice."
