			"notes": "- Mob sight dots glide across the minimap, sent twice a second instead of every tick a mob moves.\n- A mob sight or block magnet radar sits beside the minimap instead of vanishing under it.\n- Compasses and maps go in the enchanting table, which offers mob sight, block magnet and scroll.\n- Shift-clicking a compass or map puts it in its slot."
		},
