			"notes": "- Nether maps show the ground at your height, and stand it up framed on the floor.\n- Mob sight looks for what is on the map five times a second, once per map however many carry it, and the dots still move every tick.\n- A slotted block magnet is read once, not every tick the minimap asks.\n- Mob sight looks again as soon as a scrolling map moves, so the new strip's mobs don't arrive late."
		},
